  m_Name: SecondRespawn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: SecondRespawn
  dialogueLines:
  - Did you learn absolutely nothing from the first time? Come on, buddy. Reset
  - "Seriously? We\u2019re doing this again? Didn\u2019t the first reset teach you
    anything?"
  - "Oh, buddy. You really didn\u2019t learn from the first time, did you? Time for
    another reset"
  - "We\u2019ve already been through this. How did you not learn? Come on, reset"
  - Again? Really? I thought we established how this works the first time. Reset
    time
  - "Did the first reset somehow not get the message across? Alright, let\u2019s
    do it again"
  - Come on, buddy. You already learned this lesson once. Apparently we need a refresher
  - "I cannot believe we\u2019re back here again. Didn\u2019t you learn anything
    the first time?"
  - "You know what happens when you do this. We\u2019ve done this before. Reset"
  - "Oh dear, you\u2019ve gone and done it again. I guess another reset is in order"
  - Did we not have this exact conversation already? Come on, buddy. Reset time
  - You really decided to ignore everything that happened last time, huh? Alright,
    reset
  - "First time wasn\u2019t enough, apparently. Fine, let\u2019s reset you again"
  - Buddy, we literally just went through this. How are we back here already?
  - 'You had one job: learn from the first reset. Somehow, you failed. Reset time'
  - "Oh, you\u2019re doing it again. I really thought you\u2019d have learned by
    now"
  - Remember the first time this happened? Yeah, neither do you apparently. Reset
  - "Come on, you can\u2019t seriously be making the same mistake twice. Back to
    the reset"
  - "Well, I guess the first reset didn\u2019t stick. Let\u2019s try this lesson
    one more time"
  - You really learned nothing from that first reset, did you? Alright, buddy. Reset
    again
  canRepeat: 1
  priority: 5
